## First run

Needs **Node <%= nodeFloor %>+** and **npm <%= npmFloor %>+**. On an older npm the
install-script allowlist under [Dependency policy](#dependency-policy) is
accepted and silently ignored, so the workspace looks gated and is not.

```bash
npm install
<% if (uiLib) { %>npm run build:libs   # before the first serve — see below
<% } %>npm start <app>      # there is no default app: name the one to serve
```
